Z||000000||deceler8||05-03-2001||03:43 PM||||Someone mentioned they thought the Dashlight was a theft deterrent because a red LED shows when it's in your lighter socket being recharged.<P>I noticed at my local K mart that they're clearing all theirs out at $3.50. If you want one, you might check out your local K mart.<P>Also, I noticed Autozone has the black lug covers for 49 cents. I know that because I just bought 20 of them.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever2||05-03-2001||04:01 PM||||Yeah, I mentioned that I have a Dashlight, and said maybe it helps.  That wasn't what I got it for - I have a hard time reading the odometer at night, and since we never used it in the minivan, I put it in the Fiero.  The first time I went to my car at night I saw that little red light inside and hesitated, wondering if it was my car, then remembered the little flashlight.  So I think MAYBE it has a deterrent effect, I don't know.  <P>I work in a building next to a niteclub, and so far my car hasn't been messed with, knock on Enduraflex.<BR>||||reg||6
